WEBVTT

00:01:53.770 --> 00:01:55.960
Oh my!

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:01.870
He's dropped something.

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:05.200
For me? It's...

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:26.560
That's right!
Today is Santa's Day!

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.210
I'm finished!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:42.740
It may not look like much,
but it's the thought that counts!

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.830
Just you wait and see!

00:02:58.370 --> 00:02:59.960
Better get some sleep.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.500
Really? You're really
gonna lend me the money!?

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:11.370
You're not plannin' to stiff me
on the interest again, are you!?

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:16.310
What a cruel thing to say!
We're practically family!

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.150
One must help out
family members!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.480
Thanks, Nabiki!

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:23.650
Don't tell Akane, huh?

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:29.260
Tell Akane I loaned you
money for a present? Never.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.030
You promise?

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.640
Come by anytime
you need help!

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:37.000
See ya.

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:42.600
Ranma...

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:43.900
What?

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.410
Well, uh...

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:48.210
Today's uh...

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.210
All right. Go!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.250
The perfect couple.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.250
Go on your
Christmas date!

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.220
Ranma, take care of
my little Akane.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.620
Dad! Cut it
out already!

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:02.990
Really. I'd never go on a
date with a tomboy like her...

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.700
I'd rather stay home and stare at
the walls than go out with him!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:07.900
What a punch!

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.770
That's perfect then.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:15.140
Someone told me to have a
Christmas Eve party here tonight.

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:16.300
"Someone"?

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.140
Mister Santa.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.000
Mister Santa?

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.000
Santa?

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:23.550
I've already made
up the invitations.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.680
You'll help me pass
them out, won't you?

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.250
Sure...

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.250
Sure.

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:37.500
"Tendo Family Christmas Party.
TIME: Six o'clock this evening.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:42.230
PLACE: The Tendo Dojo.
PURPOSE: The exchange of gifts."

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.900
Tendo Dojo

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:46.430
It's a miracle!

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:50.880
I made it all the way to Akane's
house without getting lost!

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:54.280
Could this be love
guiding me onward?

00:04:55.950 --> 00:05:00.790
Master Kuno, isn't this a bit
ostentatious for a Christmas gift?

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:04.190
The present's size is a reflection
of the feelings in my heart!

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:09.360
This way, Akane Tendo will know
the extent of my love for her!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:14.270
I wish his lordship would extend
himself to think of the porter!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:15.900
What was that, Sasuke?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.600
Just some personal
thoughts, Master Kuno.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:22.410
That voice...!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.910
Mistress Kuno!

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:29.740
Brother, dear! No stocking
in the world could hold that!

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.890
Disaster!
What have I done?

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:38.120
Master Kuno!

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.350
What's all the
fuss about, here?

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:41.930
What YOU doing here!?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:45.760
She's right! The service
entrance is to the rear!

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:49.760
Take a gander at this.
I'm an invited guest!

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.700
You have an invitation
to the party!?

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:56.080
Shampoo is not
only one invited?

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.540
Shampoo!

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:01.110
How could you
leave me behind!?

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.410
Shampoo!

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:17.230
Wait here. The party
won't start for a while.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.630
So this is Akane Tendo's
bedchambers.

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:27.940
Just being here sends
thrills down my spine!

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.570
What's this?

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.980
There's a
picture here!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:33.910
And it's of
Master Kuno!

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:37.480
It is the heart of a
young lass in love!

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:40.850
Always wishing to view my
gentlemanly visage. Endearing.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:45.120
Uh, Master... you're not
the only one in the picture.

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:46.780
You're sort of
squeezed into a corner...

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:50.530
Perhaps my autograph will
serve to commemorate my visit.

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:55.030
I'm not gonna allow you
to defile Akane's room!

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:58.600
What impudence to give
orders to me, Tatewaki Kuno!

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.800
Very well.
I accept your challenge.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:03.810
Looks like words
aren't enough.

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.380
Master Kuno, please!

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:08.270
Come now. It's unseemly for
guests to behave this way.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:10.010
Stay outta this,
duck-boy!

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:18.150
Will you
two shape up?

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.060
There is no
excuse for this!

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.730
What's this?

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:34.200
Are you all right?
Master Kuno!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.580
Those jerks never learn.

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:43.410
Ranma, I've got my
hands full in here.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:47.010
Would you go and ask someone
to help me in the kitchen?

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:48.180
Sure.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.430
Hey...

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:04.200
C-Could one of you lend
a hand in the kitchen?

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:09.200
I'll do it.

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:11.010
I can help!

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:14.840
Leave the comestibles
to me, my dear Ranma!

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.310
I'll go, too.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.050
That's right! I have
to put up the tree!

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:26.680
Akane, you come help
trim the tree with me!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.460
Right! Let's go!

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.550
Hey, what's the deal...

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:30.600
Ranma!

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.060
What was the
meaning of that?

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.230
Playing favorites
with Akane, are we?

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:36.460
Ladies!

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:41.270
I've got an interesting
proposition for you.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:48.240
How's this, Ranma?

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:54.050
A little too much, maybe?

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:59.380
Naw, actually I was right
to ask for your help.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:00.480
Really?

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:05.060
This is so completely
tasteless and clumsy...

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:08.290
I hate to think what would've
happened if you'd been cookin'!

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.970
I see!
So that's it!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.950
So I'm clumsy!
Big deal!

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.150
I shoubba kepf
my big mouf shuf!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.420
That was a
harrowing experience.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:35.760
Who cares. Listen
to that homey sound.

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:38.830
For a Ioner like me,
this is pure heaven.

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:46.530
Where's the
soy sauce!?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:47.970
Oh, my!
Are we out, already?

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:51.770
Forgive me. We seem to
be out of soy sauce.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.070
"Soy sauce"?

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:54.980
A-Akane...

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.320
What is it, Ryoga?

00:09:57.420 --> 00:10:01.350
It's almost like we're
newlyweds or something.

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:04.420
You're so silly, Ryoga.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.220
Sh-Shampoo...

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:08.950
What it is, Mousse?

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:13.000
It's almost like we're
newlyweds or something.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:24.140
Kasumi! I'll go
get the soy sauce!

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.970
No! Allow ME to
fetch it for you!

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.010
Well, if you insist...

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:31.050
No trouble!
Come on, Shampoo!

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:35.390
I very busy cooking now!

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:42.020
Uh... Where's Akane?

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:45.700
Shall we go, Ryoga?

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:48.100
Huh? Are you
coming too, Kasumi?

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:52.360
Yes. There may be other
things I've forgotten to stock.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.770
So where do
you live, Ryoga?

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.540
Well, you can see
Mt. Fuji in the west...

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:06.590
It's somewhere in the suburbs,
near the Pacific Ocean...

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:10.580
My goodness, you must
live in a very large house.

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:15.260
Well, not really. But I've
gotten lost in it at times...

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.590
Oh, really?

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:18.060
Huh?

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.500
Goodness!
Another dead-end?

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.190
Where did they
hide the market!?

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:27.030
What's wrong,
Mister Duck?

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:30.070
I see! With a duck's-eye-view
we'll be able to locate it!

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:32.580
My, what a clever duck!

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.440
This way?
Let's go!

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.280
Bakusai tenketsu!!

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.480
Shall we?

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:47.220
Pardon us...

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.170
What's this
about a proposition?

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:16.550
I can fix it so that you can
spend time alone with Ranma.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.180
Can't do it
for free, though...

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.820
Alone with Ranma!
I happy!

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:22.020
Is this true?

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:26.070
I guarantee it! Okay, let's
start the bidding at 1000 yen!

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:34.500
I have no use
for propositions.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:38.370
With just a drop of this, I can
be alone with my darling Ranma.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:44.150
What you doing!?

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:47.080
Sorry 'bout that.
Didn't do it on purpose.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:51.120
And now for the plate...

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:59.200
Now you've done it!

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.290
We even now.

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:02.260
Why you little...

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.770
We fight?

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:16.470
What the...!?

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:18.020
She fast asleep!

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:26.950
Here comes the bearded old man...
I'm all jittery, Saotome!

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:29.360
My thoughts exactly, Tendo!

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:33.870
We haven't done anything
like this since grade school.

00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:34.660
Well?

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:37.400
It's perfect!
A horned panda!

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:41.840
Saotome, this performance
must come off without a flaw!

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:45.000
I know it! If we fail,
it's the end!

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:48.170
We must set Ranma and
Akane firmly on the path!

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:49.070
It's Soun...

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.120
And Genma's...

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.550
Operation: MATCHMAKER!

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.730
Looks like it's just about time.

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:08.600
Ya' gotta be kiddin'!
I'm not singin'!

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:11.070
Real guys don't do karaoke!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:18.000
But it's fine for a girl.
Now go get changed!

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:31.980
You're kind to me
nothing more

00:14:32.190 --> 00:14:34.790
The sadness fills my heart

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:39.330
Love is always Ioneliness

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:43.100
Into my arms
Ahh!

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:48.930
Darling
Just for me, I'll wait for you

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:53.100
I give you shivers
in your heart

00:14:53.710 --> 00:15:00.120
The romance beckoned
by your fingertips

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:06.960
It's destiny for us
to fall in love

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:18.200
Tonight
isn't it wondrous?

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:22.870
A car parked
alongside a beach

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:30.150
The two are so
close together but

00:15:31.520 --> 00:15:38.150
They're kept apart
by that invisible barrier

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:43.160
With tears overflowing

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.590
Fall in love...

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:53.160
Darling
Just for you, I won't hesitate

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:57.730
Get my heart a' throb

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:04.440
The romance that
begins in your eyes

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:09.510
I love more than any other

00:16:09.620 --> 00:16:11.820
Catch my love

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:36.810
Hi everyone! Welcome to the
Tendo Family Christmas Party!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.890
I hope you all
have a great time!

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:17.610
I've got to think of a
way to get Akane alone!
Ryoga Akane

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:23.360
Akane
I must have both!
Kuno Pigtailed Girl

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:28.260
Look what I've got!
Sasuke

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:34.270
What bliss to spend
Christmas with Shampoo!
Mousse Shampoo

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:38.600
Shampoo Ranma
Ukyo

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:44.550
Akane Ranma

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:51.560
Akane Ranma

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:52.680
That dolt.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:55.590
I have one pair.

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:56.750
Two pair.

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.420
Two pair, also.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:17:59.190
Three-of-a-kind.

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:00.630
Full house!

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.600
Junk.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:02.670
I four kind!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.670
Royal straight flush!

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:10.740
You all lose!

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:17.110
The wintry breezes
Deliver icy currents
Straight to my body.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:20.120
Rolled tightly cylindrical,
Our specialty, king salmon.

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:23.650
Okay, everyone. Now,
like it said on the invitation...

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:26.020
It's time for
us to exchange gifts.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:34.700
Is everyone ready?
Okay, then let's...

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.000
Hold everything!

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:41.340
My name is Santa Claus,
just arrived from the North Pole.

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:45.040
I've come to bring gifts
to good little children.

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:47.710
The names of those
two little children are...

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:50.580
Ranma Saotome
and Akane Tendo!

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:54.050
Come forward and
accept your gifts!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:58.260
Santa's present is
meant to last a lifetime.

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.790
It's an engagement ring!

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:04.090
Ranma, if you give Akane the
ring with witnesses present...

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:08.730
You'll have to get engaged
to Akane! A perfect plan!

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.100
What's THAT!?

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:12.570
It's a weirdo Santa!

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:16.240
What a haul!
What a haul!

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.180
Merry Christmas, Akane!

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:28.380
I was so happy when
I got your invitation!

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:32.430
I've brought you a gift!
It's not much, but...

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:37.060
Are we there yet?

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:42.290
Zentaro, thought you'd run off
and leave granny behind, eh?

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:47.600
I'm wise to your tricks! You'll
be punished when we get back!

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:50.580
Oh, NO!
Please forgive me!

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:53.370
Shampoo!
Where are you!?

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:57.280
Ranma's missing!
And so's Ukyo!

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:59.580
Shampoo!

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:01.150
He wouldn't...!

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:04.790
Akane...

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:13.920
You just sit tight,
right there. Got it?

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:17.800
You try to run, and I'll tell
everyone about you-know-what!

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:20.000
But that's not fair!

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:23.800
Take it like a man!
I'm counting on you.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:28.970
Ranma!

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:30.810
Ukyo?

00:20:31.820 --> 00:20:34.010
We're finally alone!

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:37.350
I've waited so long for this.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:39.980
Is that a
present for ME!?

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:42.860
Oh happy, happy day!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:45.360
Uh, actually,
this is for, uh...

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.770
Have to give it
that one last push!

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:48.840
That far enough!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.370
Shampoo!

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:53.430
I see the mice will play
while Kodachi's away!

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:54.530
Kodachi!?

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:58.980
What's this!? This is MY
time with Ranma! Go away!

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:02.970
That present for
Shampoo! You no have it!

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:06.220
You guys are here
way too early!

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:08.980
How can I do business if
you won't wait your turn!

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:12.690
You force me to show my strength
and steal my daring away!

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.860
You gotta
be kiddin'!

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.230
Ranma!

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:21.320
Tch tch. I got paid,
so who cares!

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:22.830
Ranma!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:23.600
Ranma!

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:25.100
Please wait!

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:25.930
Ranma!

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:28.230
Ranma darling!

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:30.570
Ranma, you wait!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.470
Ranma, you'd better wait up!

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.410
Ranma darling!

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:37.020
Akane!

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:49.190
They fall through roof!

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:50.020
Ranma!

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:52.490
Ranma, sweetums!

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:03.940
- Ranma.
- Akane.

00:22:06.710 --> 00:22:08.270
Are you still mad?

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:09.850
No...

00:22:09.950 --> 00:22:11.440
Yes, you are!

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:13.210
I am not mad!

00:22:13.320 --> 00:22:14.790
Oh really?

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:16.720
Really!

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:19.860
Here.

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:24.260
It's for you. It's Christmas.
It's not much, but...

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:29.400
It's a workers belt...
No, it's a fishin' net!

00:22:29.740 --> 00:22:32.330
It's a SCARF!
I made it myself!

00:22:32.440 --> 00:22:37.210
We both know you're all
thumbs and here you insist on...

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:43.880
If you don't like it,
give it back!

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:49.880
Idiot. No one else'd be caught
dead with this botched scarf on!

00:22:50.190 --> 00:22:51.280
Ranma...

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:52.650
Here, it's for you.

00:22:53.590 --> 00:22:57.650
It's not much, but like you said,
it's Christmas. Open it.

00:23:02.200 --> 00:23:06.660
It's a picture frame.
That's the only photo I could find.

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:08.140
You picked
this one...

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:16.850
It's not handmade, but I'm
pretty clumsy myself. Sorry.

00:23:19.520 --> 00:23:22.180
Thank you, Ranma.
It means a lot to me.

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:25.820
Akane...

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:38.090
Ranma, you'd
better start talkin'!

00:23:38.210 --> 00:23:41.000
People who play with
woman's heart, I no forgive!

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:43.540
You cad! What have
you done to Akane!?

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:45.970
W-Wait a second!
Hold it!

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:49.050
Ranma, I'll put
this on your tab.

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:54.920
Ayaah! What you touching?

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:56.320
Shampoo!

00:23:56.390 --> 00:23:57.980
You all lose!

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:07.400
Oh, my. I wonder who
this belongs to?

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:09.970
That's odd...

00:24:16.910 --> 00:24:19.470
Kasumi! Come here!
Come quick!

00:24:20.050 --> 00:24:21.710
What is it, Akane?

00:24:21.820 --> 00:24:24.250
Just come on!

00:24:24.350 --> 00:24:25.480
All right.

00:24:25.750 --> 00:24:26.880
How beautiful...

00:24:26.990 --> 00:24:29.180
That's cool!

00:24:32.290 --> 00:24:33.120
Oh my!

00:24:47.510 --> 00:24:51.570
So this must be
what was in the box!
